#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:352
#, draft
msgid "Board recipes"
msgstr "Riċetti għall-bordijiet tax-xogħol"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:354
#, draft
msgid ""
"For the boards that publish nothing a standard can read. A recipe records where one board puts each field; whatever it leaves empty is filled from the published standards."
msgstr ""
"Għall-bordijiet li ma jippubblikaw xejn li standard jista' jaqra. Riċetta tirreġistra fejn bord partikolari jqiegħed kull qasam; dak li tħalli vojt jimtela mill-istandards ippubblikati."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:412
#, draft
msgid "Page metadata"
msgstr "Metadata tal-paġna"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:300
#, draft
msgid ""
"Reads the JobPosting most large boards already publish about themselves, for search engines. A published standard the sites maintain, so it breaks far less often than guessing at their markup would."
msgstr ""
"Jaqra l-JobPosting li l-biċċa l-kbira tal-portali kbar tax-xogħol diġà jippubblikaw dwarhom infushom, għall-magni tat-tiftix. Standard ippubblikat li s-siti jżommu huma stess, għalhekk jinkiser ferm inqas milli jaqta' għall-immarkar tagħhom."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:414
#, draft
msgid ""
"The fallback, for a page with no structured data: the title it declares and its readable text. Deliberately unambitious — it saves typing and never pretends to know more than it does."
msgstr ""
"Il-fallback għal paġna mingħajr data strutturata: it-titlu li tiddikjara u t-test li jinqara tagħha. Modest apposta — jiffranka t-tajping u qatt ma jippretendi li jaf aktar milli jaf."
